              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingxenye eyisabelo sababephumile impi yayiyizimvu ezizinkulungwane ezingamakhulu amathathu lamatshumi amathathu lesikhombisa, lamakhulu amahlanu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
