          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi silethile izinto zegolide, ilowo lalowomuntu azifumeneyo, zibe ngumnikelo weNkosi, izigqizo, lamasongo lezindandatho, lamacici, lamangqongqo, ukuba sizenzele indlela yokubuyisana phambi kweNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
