              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose loEleyazare umpristi bamukela igolide ezinduneni zezinkulungwane lezinduneni zamakhulu, baliletha ethenteni lokuhlangana, laba yisikhumbuzo sabakoIsrayeli phambi kweNkosi.",
